# Undoing, in a pane zoomed into Home, an edit made in the outline pane takes the edit back without moving that pane, and redo there puts it back.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
Home:
	- Fix the shelf
END
keys G k <C-w> v
see 󰋜 › Home
keys g1 gg j <Enter>
type  now
keys <Esc> g2 z
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
Home:
	- Fix the shelf
END
see 󰋜 › Home
keys Z
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber now
Home:
	- Fix the shelf
END
